    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is a visual novel combined with a simulation management game, where you control the protagonist and embark on a journey of dreams and passion with two girls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Game Characters\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Akane Sakurajima</strong><br>The protagonist\u2019s childhood friend, who grew up playing and joking around together. Their bond began when the protagonist unintentionally helped her during their younger days. They officially started dating after graduating high school, but broke up a few years later because she couldn\u2019t tolerate his &quot;straight-man syndrome.&quot;<br>Highly capable and diligent in both academics and daily life, Akane has always been a top student and often uses this to criticize the protagonist. However, their roles are completely reversed when it comes to gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201360/extras/38e148a0b2d7470b72c07132d60c35dd.poster.avif?t=1742667351\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201360/extras/38e148a0b2d7470b72c07132d60c35dd.webm?t=1742667351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201360/extras/38e148a0b2d7470b72c07132d60c35dd.mp4?t=1742667351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suzuka Morimiya</strong><br>The protagonist\u2019s neighbor in his rental apartment. With her husband frequently away on long business trips, Suzuka finds herself overwhelmed by unmet emotional and physical needs, which lead her to develop an inexplicable affection for the somewhat immature young man next door.<br>On the surface, she is a gentle and caring older-sister figure. However, deep down, she seems to be harboring severe family issues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Game Features\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2764 Full Japanese voice acting for the two heroines<br>\u2764 Both heroines available for H-scenes and training<br>\u2764 4K high-quality animated HCG<br>\u2764 Visual novel + simulation gameplay<br>\u2764 One-handed controls for a seamless experience<br>\u2764 Character costume customization + live2D interactions<br><br><strong>\u3010Special Thanks\u3011</strong><br>Testers: Reopen,Sexy female dragon<br>Translation:\u00a0English / Janna, Korean / Rita, Japanese / Faunas+ (@Faunas_Plus)</p>",
