aring older-sister figure. However, deep down, she seems to be harboring severe family issues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Game Features\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2764 Full Japanese voice acting for the two heroines<br>\u2764 Both heroines available for H-scenes and training<br>\u2764 4K high-quality animated HCG<br>\u2764 Visual novel + simulation gameplay<br>\u2764 One-handed controls for a seamless experience<br>\u2764 Character costume customization + live2D interactions<br><br><strong>\u3010Special Thanks\u3011</strong><br>Testers: Reopen,Sexy female dragon<br>Translation:\u00a0English / Janna, Korean / Rita, Japanese / Faunas+ (@Faunas_Plus)</p>",
